\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. BY CHRIST redeemed, in Christ restored,
\par We keep the memory adored,
\par And show the death of our dear Lord
\par Unil He come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. His body, broken in our stead,
\par Is here in this memorial bread,
\par And so our feeble love is fed
\par Until He come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The drops of His dread agony,
\par His life-blood shed for us, we see;
\par The wine shall tell the mystery
\par Until He come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. And thus that dark betrayal night
\par With the last advent we unite,
\par By one blest chain of loving rite,
\par Until He come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O blessed hope! With this elate,
\par Let not our hearts be desolate,
\par But, strong in faith, in patience wait
\par Until He come.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

